oy vatañe","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vaho tsy ivaliha’e;","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tsy mitake ana’e t’ie mampisongo drala, tsy mandrambe vokàñe","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"haneseke ty vantañe;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"le lia’e tsy hitroetroe ty manao Izay.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/tdx_sle/PSA/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/tdx_sle/PSA/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/tdx_sle/PSA/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}